  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A person throws a stone from the top of a cliff horizontally with initial speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 0\"></span>, near the surface of the Earth. The stone hits the ground below the cliff at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 10 \\; \\textup{s}\"></span>. Air resistance is not negligible. </p>\n<p>Which of the following statements is true about the vertical acceleration of the stone at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t = 7 \\; \\textup{s}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g\"></span>.</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g\"></span>.</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">Equal to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"g\"></span>.</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">Depends only on <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>.</li>\n</ol>"
